WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
What about football games?

2
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.440
Did ROTC go as a unit?

3
00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:03.760
Yes.

4
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:14.900
At that particular time we all had tickets and the student body in those days—it’s quite different now—used to sit as a group right with the band.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:20.440
And you were more or less obligated to go.

6
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.640
Of course that was one of the fine things about it.

7
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.280
LSU had a good team.

8
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.940
Night football had just come in.

9
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:33.320
And at one game, the homecoming game, you were obligated to wear your pajamas.

10
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:33.960
We did.

11
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:42.100
I did, and that was all part of the tradition and the ceremony that followed as a result of you being a freshman.
